    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are hereby appointed as the Surveillance Officer for Facility Surveillance Operations. During a five-day probationary period, your work performance will be evaluated. Your continued employment will be determined based on your performance and health condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please repeatedly &quot;Surveillance&quot; and &quot;Search&quot; to arrive at the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793240/extras/4a6885845470be889c66efd102f762fb.avif?t=1755273274\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Anomaly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Evolve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It undergoes three changes. Early reporting increases rewards.<br>Changes: objects appear, vanish, and move. Prolonged neglect causes camera failure.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793240/extras/003acd0d1ff9d3c25afe86b10c456359.avif?t=1755273274\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear anomaly appears / Camera placement and footage differ, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer questions from On-Site Staff appropriately.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793240/extras/5da3ce20366d06ee10f2c3afe19750b6.avif?t=1755273274\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Search</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can view information about anomalies and operations by searching by ID or two distinct words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793240/extras/f992dd9d6d3125c88622f27de38c6151.avif?t=1755273274\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Additional Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each tasks lasts about 12 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are about 60 anomalies in each facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are 20 endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6How to play the old version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the old version by following these steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Select &quot;Surveillance Work&quot; from your Steam library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Click the gear icon in the top right and select &quot;Properties&quot; at the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Select the &quot;Beta&quot; tab and select &quot;Legacy - \u65e7\u30d0\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3&quot; from the drop-down list in the top right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Video Upload and Live Stream Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Surveillance Work -Taboo-&quot; may be uploaded or streamed by individuals and organizations without prior approval.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please adhere to the following guidelines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Include the game's name in your video title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We kindly request that you include a link to the Steam page in your video description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Monetization is permitted only if you use the monetization features provided by video-sharing platforms, such as the YouTube Partner Program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Developer Maki Toguro assumes no responsibility for any damages arising from the posting or streaming of game videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Do not use any part of the in-game ending sequence in your live streams or as video thumbnails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Please refrain from uploading videos that consist solely of the in-game ending sequence, whether in its original form or simply spliced together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The term &quot;ending sequence&quot; refers to any section labeled as &quot;Ending&quot; or &quot;???&quot; in the upper left corner of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* There is absolutely no issue with showing the ending sequence during live streams or gameplay commentary when progressing through or completing &quot;Surveillance Work -Taboo-.&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are hereby appointed as the Surveillance Officer for Facility Surveillance Operations. During a five-day probationary period, your work performance will be evaluated. Your continued employment will be determined based on your performance and health condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please repeatedly &quot;Surveillance&quot; and &quot;Search&quot; to arrive at the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793240/extras/4a6885845470be889c66efd102f762fb.avif?t=1755273274\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Anomaly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Evolve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It undergoes three changes. Early reporting increases rewards.<br>Changes: objects appear, vanish, and move. Prolonged neglect causes camera failure.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793240/extras/003acd0d1ff9d3c25afe86b10c456359.avif?t=1755273274\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear anomaly appears / Camera placement and footage differ, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer questions from On-Site Staff appropriately.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793240/extras/5da3ce20366d06ee10f2c3afe19750b6.avif?t=1755273274\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Search</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can view information about anomalies and operations by searching by ID or two distinct words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793240/extras/f992dd9d6d3125c88622f27de38c6151.avif?t=1755273274\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Additional Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each tasks lasts about 12 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are about 60 anomalies in each facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are 20 endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6How to play the old version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the old version by following these steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Select &quot;Surveillance Work&quot; from your Steam library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Click the gear icon in the top right and select &quot;Properties&quot; at the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Select the &quot;Beta&quot; tab and select &quot;Legacy - \u65e7\u30d0\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3&quot; from the drop-down list in the top right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Video Upload and Live Stream Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Surveillance Work -Taboo-&quot; may be uploaded or streamed by individuals and organizations without prior approval.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please adhere to the following guidelines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Include the game's name in your video title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We kindly request that you include a link to the Steam page in your video description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Monetization is permitted only if you use the monetization features provided by video-sharing platforms, such as the YouTube Partner Program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Developer Maki Toguro assumes no responsibility for any damages arising from the posting or streaming of game videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Do not use any part of the in-game ending sequence in your live streams or as video thumbnails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Please refrain from uploading videos that consist solely of the in-game ending sequence, whether in its original form or simply spliced together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The term &quot;ending sequence&quot; refers to any section labeled as &quot;Ending&quot; or &quot;???&quot; in the upper left corner of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* There is absolutely no issue with showing the ending sequence during live streams or gameplay commentary when progressing through or completing &quot;Surveillance Work -Taboo-.&quot;</p>",
